---
description: Python FastAPI backend conventions
globs: backend/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

- Target Python 3.12.
- Use type hints on public functions and API contracts.
- Keep FastAPI routers thin; route handlers delegate to small functions when logic grows.
- Keep business logic out of HTTP/router modules.
- Use Pydantic models for request and response contracts.
- Use `pydantic-settings` for environment-based application configuration.
- Prefer simple, readable Python over unnecessary abstractions.
- Add or update tests for changed backend behavior.
